{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-104.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Fairytaller_Entrance_Occupied_0d170bf", "nodeNames": ["Fairytaller_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1510, "source": "Fairytaller: Но боюсь, что мне будет некомфортно, пока в одном помещении со мной есть {0}.", "sourceSha256": "392c4360e8cc8ad166b08a512c37a897066fe9b7dc6ca305c8ec0cc92e3948a6", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457492570115", "target": "Fairytaller: Maar ik vrees dat ik me ongemakkelijk zal voelen zolang ik de ruimte deel met dit gezelschap: {0}.", "targetSha256": "f2893b7b23211fec4b4025063787ea30a768d1a083f491db3605d1a3fe090964"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-125.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Leper_Entrance_Occupied_06e50d7", "nodeNames": ["Leper_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1522, "source": "Leper: Тут уже есть {0}, а именно этот человек чмырил меня за внешность.", "sourceSha256": "8a5a866d3df1a681e23de724a4ff9d45ef9b8324db5e2edd3da8c3cd593a59be", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457488375810", "target": "Leper: Kijk wie hier al is: {0}. Juist die persoon kleineerde me om mijn uiterlijk.", "targetSha256": "1c71f3433af0c3d3ebe19129ea91e40359216a1d5a1580b273e74aacd062b13c"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-149.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Nervous_Entrance_Occupied_03f5f29", "nodeNames": ["Nervous_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1535, "source": "Nervous: А, тут есть {0}.", "sourceSha256": "75d5bf6a269d455da1ec19183dc9737519da2592904d731d89e6653d9762911f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457484181504", "target": "Nervous: O, kijk wie hier is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "175e3bd3a7e09361c7e4a3771782fe1f1bc6a194a83960bb9492b47f8006223c"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-119.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Bald_Entrance_Occupied_0b1927e", "nodeNames": ["Bald_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1543, "source": "Bald: Тут у тебя {0}. Давай, может, как-то вытурнем?", "sourceSha256": "277861c65d75f83fe4e800ad34c5165817038c7313bf94d33b38d45cd0ea2e35", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457479987203", "target": "Bald: Kijk wie hier bij je zit: {0}. Zullen we die misschien op de een of andere manier eruit werken?", "targetSha256": "1859811b1cd3c0e11b6e61238bf70d38239b2bb8db50be6e019e5c91c08e961a"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-186.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Tough_Entrance_Occupied_08be726", "nodeNames": ["Tough_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1553, "source": "Tough: Кто это у тебя тут, {0}?", "sourceSha256": "ebb6b546ec0308dc838951c89b5cf0d622e7aefed34d1cd03c9f16329d97ad6f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457475792901", "target": "Tough: Wie heb je hier in huis — {0}?", "targetSha256": "d66879cad0adc4f04bac40fee9ddad0d16fbd885563fb81186d7e1299c81f8c1"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-122.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Jacket_Entrance_Occupied_088628d", "nodeNames": ["Jacket_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1825, "source": "Jacket: Ой… Извините, но у вас {0}. Я не очень доверяю таким людям…", "sourceSha256": "4c65aafbc67c71dbd623c7430d8bb0258a353d8ce09bc128ec2a42a78eb3c823", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457379323904", "target": "Jacket: O… Het spijt me, maar u hebt gezelschap in huis: {0}. Ik vertrouw zulke mensen niet erg…", "targetSha256": "90ae92deb8659801387618243f942f767c3f3324b6c3c8d8f909eda2103aff71"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-260.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Experienced_Entrance_Occupied_0ec9683", "nodeNames": ["Experienced_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1860, "source": "Experienced: Мне не по душе {0}.", "sourceSha256": "7381211711001b18646b99d4fdaf8f3a4dfd4409caf0e4f1f85898557a45116d", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457366740994", "target": "Experienced: Dit gezelschap staat me niet aan: {0}.", "targetSha256": "328081deff0af166626dd0ac693d96e9034e77f59ea3220edaac5dbf073aeeea"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-255.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Unstable_Entrance_Occupied_09de6e6", "nodeNames": ["Unstable_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 1938, "source": "Unstable: Опа, у тебя тут {0}.", "sourceSha256": "fbd7e26c448502e9304a87826c8d80c5c8a18ef8b6c5b239f34c6e8ee3257276", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457337380872", "target": "Unstable: Hé, je hebt hier gezelschap: {0}.", "targetSha256": "0f49e974c3fe84b55c0ae821eaeaed0a6f0e8d7f1fb1764a43065d503ab86507"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-235.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Wolfhound_Entrance_Occupied_0b92df6", "nodeNames": ["Wolfhound_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2199, "source": "Wolfhound: У тебя {0} уже греет очаг? Сразу вижу, что это волчица в овечьей шкуре.", "sourceSha256": "a572cfd9e58b0bcf60cf2a3dc5e45b53cdb3c5d1cfb8e1f78a9d139a31b9d6a2", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457245106180", "target": "Wolfhound: Wie zit hier al bij je haard — {0}? Ik zie meteen dat het een wolvin in schaapskleren is.", "targetSha256": "db8be0408d9d410e1a22acb3a4a1c8d76b64b37015fe74ed9cb49c7ad0b7b7ee"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-088.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Twins_Entrance_AlkonostOccupied_0a0e768", "nodeNames": ["Twins_Entrance_AlkonostOccupied"], "ordinal": 2220, "source": "Twins: Боюсь, что у вас уже сидит {0}.", "sourceSha256": "c04c64eb962fe92f88c0a45b3eff7438df3ed07e7e2e9d4db740de8835c7050f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457236717575", "target": "Twins: Ik vrees dat er al gezelschap bij u zit: {0}.", "targetSha256": "ab16c1a4ee3f67286174d9c8f469739f033ccfe4264e0ed4dcff1fce99e176dc"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-215.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Greatmother_Entrance_Occupied_00fa855", "nodeNames": ["Greatmother_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2226, "source": "Greatmother: Опа, это {0} сидит у тебя тут, что ли?  Вот так встреча!", "sourceSha256": "f3a65ee901013888906fe04220b0c3f8d56a9f82c7fa228aab96b256e7d2fdaa", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457236717569", "target": "Greatmother: Hé, wie zit hier bij jou — {0}? Wat een ontmoeting!", "targetSha256": "c8a26cc145107dc14dc114e324b9cc2a66b4c340ad187190cdea9ae2050d83b8"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-285.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Widow_Entrance_Occupied_0d12664", "nodeNames": ["Widow_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2232, "source": "Widow: У тебя тут {0}?", "sourceSha256": "8580998785ce89f22e3999cd88027dcedead607418ea367349847a2817c8938f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457232523271", "target": "Widow: Wie is hier bij jou — {0}?", "targetSha256": "837d9285566c99f519803a09519e623213f7b4f6113bd30df257bf67859b8bb3"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-223.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:FormerFema_Entrance_Occupied_02d91db", "nodeNames": ["FormerFema_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2304, "source": "FormerFema: О-ох… вижу, в ванной уже {0}.", "sourceSha256": "75868ef8321be41948e9d551225ce367a43be2a969b10ad5a88d48597be31f85", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457207357443", "target": "FormerFema: O… ik zie wie er al in de badkamer is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "3b405d217245d1e080c82e135edb9be49bf4c6a04685c2f42133cb60a92350eb"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-134.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:GraveDigger_Entrance_Occupied_0b2fe8b", "nodeNames": ["GraveDigger_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2311, "source": "GraveDigger: Ё-маё, да у тебя тут уже {0}.", "sourceSha256": "d7512ddb74fa24c2933f2912aa0c1bc473614b9d15ffbb477c0b16847ad5d1a5", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457203163141", "target": "GraveDigger: Potverdorie, je hebt al gezelschap in huis: {0}.", "targetSha256": "e632c90afea9db1dc74798b88e3a9929011ce6ff0bb5b357cffe881e420018ee"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-219.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Provocateur_Entrance_Occupied_0b239f6", "nodeNames": ["Provocateur_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2325, "source": "Provocateur: Мда… вижу у вас уже в доме {0}.", "sourceSha256": "312c106d4f9031384325a95b93bfede3521f76868e56eeca8d33addf8e560fbd", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457198968834", "target": "Provocateur: Tja… ik zie wie u al in huis hebt: {0}.", "targetSha256": "f9f14dbf69cce3c366a2a529596b996da6d45397753c0b3f958c5377cf4504b5"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-170.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:TaxiDriver_Entrance_Occupied_02a5fb2", "nodeNames": ["TaxiDriver_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2333, "source": "TaxiDriver: Ты, как бы, не пойми меня неправильно, но у тебя дома {0}.", "sourceSha256": "33ea2ab51127b2fa7edb6fee179c38b1637d7f2b4bd6001523dd0f320d6b2885", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457194774534", "target": "TaxiDriver: Begrijp me niet verkeerd, maar je hebt gezelschap in huis: {0}.", "targetSha256": "483ce62cfbde1461446bd39fba27ea18d50a66b1d111c0803f6b472c671c92a2"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-131.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Edgar_Entrance_Occupied_0801104", "nodeNames": ["Edgar_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2340, "source": "Edgar: Я бы вошёл, но там уже {0}. Этот человек всё ещё тревожится о завтра…", "sourceSha256": "d8a9ce362a58a590148e22bfa61657082fc9fef344379d6ecdf374c46e03f3a4", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457190580234", "target": "Edgar: Ik zou binnenkomen, maar kijk wie daar al is: {0}. Die persoon maakt zich nog altijd zorgen over morgen…", "targetSha256": "eb644658e6298ae5f1914e71967ab0d6125fed6b723426db784e754a2ae71b54"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-108.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Foreigner_Entrance_Occupied_0b5a0dd", "nodeNames": ["Foreigner_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2344, "source": "Foreigner: (Похоже, ему не нравится {0}. Он указывает на него, потом на себя, потом опять на него).", "sourceSha256": "4cd390a19738d1c46a7350b5028aed2a2e6ab0f29f75869b970e9378a4b3397a", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457190580230", "target": "Foreigner: (Het lijkt erop dat hij dit gezelschap niet mag: {0}. Hij wijst naar hem, dan naar zichzelf en daarna weer naar hem.)", "targetSha256": "1c79f10df3747618f252817347d51f3cd43c06cb38f3a2208e4d2d0a183d82b8"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-015.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Daughter_Entrance_Occupied_099f4da", "nodeNames": ["Daughter_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2371, "source": "Daughter: Ой, {0} тут.", "sourceSha256": "b9f23b747535f945d2a0b8828bf11bf278cee505fa2335f3e22992694c445a96", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457177997323", "target": "Daughter: O, kijk wie hier is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "aab26ebee3bc01443bd0e7e5c7577c5b662e5e3a6283806df3d6adbfb4edddd0"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-290.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Scammer_Entrance_Occupied_0145e70", "nodeNames": ["Scammer_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2379, "source": "Scammer: Слышь, у тебя тут уже {0}. С такого ни денег не стрясти, ни историй каких прикольных.", "sourceSha256": "7ebdb4412498f5e168745f40f3e11f44c4fcbecb36a7236ea7457fb418f3aefb", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457177997315", "target": "Scammer: Hé, je hebt hier al gezelschap: {0}. Daar valt geen geld of leuk verhaal uit te halen.", "targetSha256": "b7cb407f719a8a5d423cf1603316a527049532eda41badf9d3aac9403babfdf4"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-182.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Cold_Entrance_Occupied_06babc2", "nodeNames": ["Cold_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2387, "source": "Cold: Спасибо… А, у тебя уже тут кто-то есть. Я не зайду, пока здесь {0}.", "sourceSha256": "0e309f4a4b3dc0c6bcd42a7cee2abde3cc90f64e24102cccc79f6f5c7d0feee7", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457173803015", "target": "Cold: Bedankt… O, er is hier al iemand. Ik kom niet binnen zolang er hier al gezelschap is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "2755bdbd36765f9c67b51184ac96ebc701ca95d9edb9cfa68b3138ecc6ac49bd"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-250.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Esenin_Entrance_Occupied_0c50315", "nodeNames": ["Esenin_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2393, "source": "Esenin: Пусть сперва свалит {0}, потом поговорим.", "sourceSha256": "ba3920f64dbbbfd9c6de118ccff4ca28931dba9634d6ece91c1359af7aedc940", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457173803009", "target": "Esenin: Laat die hier eerst oprotten: {0}. Dan praten we verder.", "targetSha256": "6d503b2a1cd3c36a7e381c5d5412f73917045d524b0864f728686090e1a3e43e"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-049.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Fanatic_Entrance_Occupied_01deafb", "nodeNames": ["Fan_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2415, "source": "Fanatic: Человек! СОЛНЦЕ велит не входить, покуда в доме таится {0}.", "sourceSha256": "9f06351c2454dc819ddd91a8e0c9fe33e48fe8881bb98d4dd508fa86912567b0", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457165414403", "target": "Fanatic: Mens! De ZON gebiedt me niet binnen te gaan zolang dit gezelschap zich in je huis schuilhoudt: {0}.", "targetSha256": "bd842ab1284c91c2130d78a9c2e4a13dfa9a492bfeeec136a9583341e48aae7b"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-097.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Luka_Entrance_Occupied_0cee69b", "nodeNames": ["Luka_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2434, "source": "Luka: С удовольствием вошёл бы, но сейчас там {0}.", "sourceSha256": "06dec514b8624800396ac6dfc7bf8627fbbb0c2196392602d901ac7d4355c71c", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457157025800", "target": "Luka: Ik zou graag binnenkomen, maar kijk wie daar op dit moment is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "5f0c784c7b9b0b049eeb5b592dcf680973c3c353efc38b1b0b15648e78c33fe9"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-280.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Couple_Entrance_Occupied_03995e6", "nodeNames": ["Couple_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2444, "source": "Couple: Ох, мне, конечно, очень неудобно вас напрягать, но мы не сможем жить, когда рядом {0}…", "sourceSha256": "3d9952e82a6b15da40e28e9efa98b87224e50b5568c8eae881c9628b623db027", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457152831498", "target": "Couple: O, ik vind het heel vervelend om u hiermee lastig te vallen, maar we kunnen niet samenleven met dit gezelschap in de buurt: {0}…", "targetSha256": "c6e77b1591fa408ab5304969135c72fbe178dc5fe1d1427ec263a1ca2a46047d"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-211.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Anger_Entrance_Occupied_0ed7227", "nodeNames": ["Anger_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2456, "source": "Anger: У тебя тут {0}?", "sourceSha256": "e58d7042a25e51cd128e09499e6746f5d45cf7101936e6fa37b7e812509e6513", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457148637194", "target": "Anger: Wie is hier bij jou — {0}?", "targetSha256": "bb17b9ef5ffe37a65e690ed7b959fe0f35a5fa33e1d85ce78654c30ca6beb6be"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-195.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Ballerina_Entrance_Occupied_0a88b7b", "nodeNames": ["Ballerina_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2473, "source": "Ballerina: У тебя есть {0}?", "sourceSha256": "0b906494728144019985de6cda7641d511232eebe8961e519bb181b9360532ec", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457144442885", "target": "Ballerina: Wie heb je in huis — {0}?", "targetSha256": "c18b8ab22714d544c00c20aaad766be2b2a071a6466594a3ac834573d3045b3a"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-231.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Teacher_Entrance_Occupied_0183941", "nodeNames": ["Teacher_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2481, "source": "Teacher: Простите, я вижу, у вас тут {0}?", "sourceSha256": "2ccd3c53aa45587d7c2d9e90e815f673a5e9157266212fe016dda2cc3d17f78f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457140248585", "target": "Teacher: Neem me niet kwalijk, ik zie dat u hier gezelschap hebt — {0}?", "targetSha256": "dc1f2050d3490dc2b3c6f836507cce352651ac8087dd132bbe09bb0fc105466c"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-155.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Blind_Entrance_Occupied_0fedfcd", "nodeNames": ["Blind_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2501, "source": "Blind: Я чувствую, что у тебя здесь {0}. Что-то не так с этим человеком.", "sourceSha256": "a4803b196e8b7f907bab9bc566e1a55dcfe4991ab343efd01ac101099555f533", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457136054274", "target": "Blind: Ik voel wie hier bij je is: {0}. Er klopt iets niet aan die persoon.", "targetSha256": "dfe0919104756726fc2661971be29f6d958867873bd936fbd9d5df5088db75be"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-270.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Fatman_Entrance_Occupied_0b49840", "nodeNames": ["Fatman_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2508, "source": "Fatman: Я лучше тебе что-нибудь подгоню, чтобы ты… их своей пушкой… того-этого!", "sourceSha256": "a9b8feccf70829a2be9578a0697910ddda3c4a3885d063010212e55f09f32e1e", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457131859974", "target": "Fatman: Ik geef je liever iets, zodat je… ze met je geweer… je weet wel!", "targetSha256": "7b787f2d932b9970ef63c433ca17d0c6e2a9100d274767867b40d0fb119ae87d"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-270.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Fatman_Entrance_Occupied_0be05e8", "nodeNames": ["Fatman_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2509, "source": "Fatman: Бляха, у тебя тут… {0}. Гони к херам! Я не готов пиздиться… за ванну.", "sourceSha256": "17c1061e8c67356041b3e14b5ed8ddccd2099786e59e6f5d76534124bc4ec662", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457131859973", "target": "Fatman: Verdomme, je hebt hier gezelschap… {0}. Jaag die de deur uit! Ik ben niet klaar om… voor een bad te vechten.", "targetSha256": "3364cc9ae5407f3f532a0d8a33799272d6707874163630ed6ec28a5dd2060def"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-203.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "glossary-referents", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Buddy_Entrance_Occupied_0900d8b", "nodeNames": ["Buddy_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2514, "source": "Buddy: О-о, корешок, гляжу у тебя уже {0} греет местечко.", "sourceSha256": "f0e11821508aac1f663ddf1e14f82ac3a4c4772276f03f888c5bbd976685f1eb", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457131859968", "target": "Buddy: O, maatje, ik zie wie bij jou al een plekje warmhoudt: {0}.", "targetSha256": "140a5b74db761d349698f25d19874998b9379155b1d3f7f8d9af35f1480462b0"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-227.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Bestson_Entrance_Occupied_0309a57", "nodeNames": ["Bestson_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2522, "source": "Bestson: Я вижу, у тебя уже {0} на диване. Меня… ну… меня пугают такие мужчины.", "sourceSha256": "386b5b0407b0d7574c2a40fb83e27b3494e9d768538f4f6a9ab441d26c64a60e", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457127665668", "target": "Bestson: Ik zie wie er al op je bank zit: {0}. Ik… nou… ik ben bang voor zulke mannen.", "targetSha256": "f4d73c8fa5f9b5dcd67ec649374906d632c49a0c01555fd4b284b57c2104fd0f"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-085.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Fugitive_Entrance_Occupied_02bb908", "nodeNames": ["Fugitive_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2533, "source": "Fugitive: Не могу… Приятель, я, бывало, на таких людей натыкался. У тебя вот в доме  {0}.", "sourceSha256": "c048c717547c035e0fe81f92fe9bc4c0b9bbe5853ea7280046009b285c47929e", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457123471364", "target": "Fugitive: Dat kan ik niet… Vriend, ik ben zulke mensen wel eens tegengekomen. Kijk wie er bij jou in huis is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "cca7cab1f931d22553b356c7b45fd7e0310935b21d1a8733e84c85a932ac5e7a"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-167.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Nun_Entrance_Occupied_08f7764", "nodeNames": ["Nun_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2543, "source": "Nun: Так, кто это тут у вас — {0}.", "sourceSha256": "d034a948c95e08ce3c41fb9baa7673dd4e93406e82ddf56f5f69163f842e354e", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457119277062", "target": "Nun: Zo, wie is hier bij u — {0}?", "targetSha256": "c28359ec11c71d8ea016b0c753bbd1d2b3667aa098c0e94035bbb2454f43e912"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-158.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Entrance_Occupied_0729667", "nodeNames": ["Raskolnikov_Entrance_Occupied"], "ordinal": 2553, "source": "Raskolnikov: Ты прости, я не хочу показаться грубым, но у тебя уже {0}.", "sourceSha256": "242329cfe9226bdc3602bb7cb5a4bd0c1eff9a4e952dc51222994553afd6ff78", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457115082760", "target": "Raskolnikov: Neem me niet kwalijk, ik wil niet onbeleefd klinken, maar je hebt al gezelschap: {0}.", "targetSha256": "8cc034e4d627ed12af5a53d9ee6980049e03968d3d0dd5a0cd848af5718a3c91"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-173.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Twins_Entrance_Occupied_0880fa9", "nodeNames": [], "ordinal": 4613, "source": "Twins: Пожалуй, нет, здесь {0}.", "sourceSha256": "19a44cf8351b2b267786f9cf414aa557d14e2b23610977edaad54bcbf85acf4f", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456393662471", "target": "Twins: Ik denk het niet. Kijk wie hier is: {0}.", "targetSha256": "7578bc4da2be63474114a6bda939b9af3a03dd4f84e3e77997e9b017ad8677dd"}
{"authoredPath": "Translations/nl/dialogue-batch-211.json", "collection": "Dialogs", "components": ["changed", "context", "repetitions", "runtime-bindings", "mandatory-regressions"], "key": "line:Anger_Entrance_Occupied_076f124", "nodeNames": [], "ordinal": 4653, "source": "Anger: ...Ага. Понятно. Здесь уже {0}. Я только глянул — и сразу ясно: все тут тихо дышат, прогибаются, лишь бы не тронули. Таких я не переношу.", "sourceSha256": "6897327f8e77fb8ee0f5c202a0865d59e5c4d2ce70d8a1e96135e2122b98189a", "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456381079553", "target": "Anger: ...Aha. Duidelijk. Kijk wie hier al is: {0}. Eén blik was genoeg: iedereen hier houdt zich stil en kruipt voor een ander, als ze maar met rust worden gelaten. Zulke mensen kan ik niet uitstaan.", "targetSha256": "7d42ee4c3ed25ce65a973b6153d200c7a1c807409b40537d3811d70a3a378d5e"}
